1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,797
One price that moves almost everything else.

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:07,484
Oil is one of the five commodities on Meme Street.

3
00:00:07,853 --> 00:00:11,708
In the real world, it powers transport and industry around the globe.

4
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:19,664
Demand comes from fuel for cars, ships and lorries, jet fuel for flights, and plastics and chemicals.

5
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:27,323
It's used in transport, flights and plastics, so when oil moves, costs ripple through the whole economy.

6
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:32,980
What makes it different is that supply shocks can move it very fast.

7
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:42,631
What can push it down? A slowing economy, extra supply, and inflation data that changes the outlook.

8
00:00:42,979 --> 00:00:47,318
On Meme Street, data and headlines hit the news wire, and the price reacts.

9
00:00:47,818 --> 00:00:49,761
Trade oil at memestreet.net.

